# Build-context exclusions for the Web (nginx) image.
#
# The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, and this project's untracked build output is
# large: node_modules ~92 MB, obj ~137 MB, bin ~185 MB. Without this file every
# build ships ~400 MB to the Docker daemon and the Windows-generated
# obj/project.assets.json leaks into the Linux restore.
#
# node_modules is only needed to REGENERATE wwwroot/js/vendor (`npm run build`);
# that bundle is committed, so the image build itself needs no Node at all.

**/bin/
**/obj/
node_modules/

# esbuild scratch entries produced by build/bundle.mjs
build/.entries/

# Dev-only overrides — never part of a deployed image.
wwwroot/appsettings.Development.json
.env

# IDE / VCS noise
.vs/
*.user
Properties/launchSettings.json
